  "worked_solution": "The line of reflection is the perpendicular bisector of the segments joining each point to its image. \n\nTherefore, the line of reflection is $y=-2,$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224812/assets/7b77cd63f7a93a62576846ad92b5ce2bcc1853137c5f582de42c2ebce4001892.png)",
